## Critical

Examples are **evaluation only**. Never keyword → template. Never if/else on illustration sentences.

## Build

```
Input → Care Reality Object → Reasoning → Orientation
```

Not: Input → keyword match → pre-written answer.

## Care Reality Object (required)

person · events · observations · changes · decisions · outcomes · relationships · unknowns · confidence (engine-only)

## Pipeline

1 Care recipient · 2 Event/observation · 3 Change · 4 Connect · 5 Unknowns · 6 Understanding response

## Never

Diagnose · treatment recommendations · dementia-progression theater · invent facts · therapy empathy · document summary as product · hardcode doc examples

